1
00:00:24,827 --> 00:00:26,537
<font color="white">積頓…</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:38,758 --> 00:00:41,302
<font color="white">奇怪？剛才發生了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:41,385 --> 00:00:44,764
<font color="white">喂，你在做什麼？我們要抵達現場了</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:44,847 --> 00:00:46,390
<font color="white">知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:48,726 --> 00:00:49,685
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:02:24,155 --> 00:02:25,823
<font color="white">各位能看看這裡嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:02:25,906 --> 00:02:28,200
<font color="white">聽說犯人的外星人挾持人質</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:02:28,284 --> 00:02:30,411
<font color="white">據守在這棟大樓</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:02:31,745 --> 00:02:33,289
<font color="white">自從事件發生後已過了兩小時…</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:33,372 --> 00:02:34,498
<font color="white">喂，你們看！</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:35,124 --> 00:02:37,543
<font color="white">啊，有一架直升機來了！</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:37,626 --> 00:02:38,878
<font color="white">會是科學特搜隊嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:39,670 --> 00:02:42,381
<font color="white">現場的採訪記者又增加了</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:42,464 --> 00:02:45,009
<font color="white">看來我們備受大家矚目啊</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:45,676 --> 00:02:48,554
<font color="white">不，那些人想要的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">只是獨家新聞的題材</font></font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:49,138 --> 00:02:51,307
<font color="white">不要分心，我們走</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:53,017 --> 00:02:54,101
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:59,815 --> 00:03:01,150
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:01,233 --> 00:03:04,028
<font color="white">-加油啊！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:04,111 --> 00:03:06,864
<font color="white">-加油！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你們一定做得到！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:06,947 --> 00:03:10,367
<font color="white">像這樣引起騷動的話</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">犯人一定知道我們來了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:12,244
<font color="white">你說得沒錯</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:14,788 --> 00:03:17,041
<font color="white">那我們上吧</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:23,130 --> 00:03:24,298
{\an8}<font color="white">怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:25,299 --> 00:03:27,176
<font color="white">小子，看你做了什麼好事</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:27,843 --> 00:03:30,346
<font color="white">你也該學會控制自己的力量了</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:34,016 --> 00:03:36,101
<font color="white">已經過了五分鐘</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:36,185 --> 00:03:39,396
<font color="white">建築物裡面究竟發生了什麼事呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:40,856
<font color="white">（快報，外星人挾持人質）</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:46,362 --> 00:03:47,488
<font color="white">那是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:48,739 --> 00:03:49,782
<font color="white">請看那裡</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:49,865 --> 00:03:52,993
<font color="white">看來超人力霸王剛才已平安救出人質</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:55,746 --> 00:03:57,456
<font color="white">好厲害啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:58,999 --> 00:04:02,002
<font color="white">超人力霸王又大顯身手啦</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:02,753 --> 00:04:06,006
<font color="white">這件事昨天還上了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">熱門趨勢的話題吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:07,258 --> 00:04:09,051
<font color="white">我不知道那算不算表現活躍</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:10,344 --> 00:04:13,722
<font color="white">太好了，人質們都平安無事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">而且比預定的更快解決了這起事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:13,806 --> 00:04:14,974
<font color="white">你錯了</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:15,057 --> 00:04:16,558
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:16,642 --> 00:04:18,978
<font color="white">在那樣的情況下，你應該優先確保</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:19,061 --> 00:04:21,397
<font color="white">人質與圍觀群眾的安全</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:22,022 --> 00:04:23,941
<font color="white">下次不要再犯了</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:24,775 --> 00:04:26,193
<font color="white">別出現如此不小心的破壞行為</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:28,529 --> 00:04:29,822
<font color="white">怎麼了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:29,905 --> 00:04:31,198
<font color="white">啊，沒什麼</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:31,782 --> 00:04:34,410
<font color="white">不說這個了，玲奈小姐才厲害呢</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:35,244 --> 00:04:37,162
{\an8}<font color="white">妳重返偶像之路的第一份工作</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:37,246 --> 00:04:40,666
{\an8}<font color="white">就被選為城市復興祈願典禮的總司儀</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:41,542 --> 00:04:43,419
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:45,004 --> 00:04:46,880
<font color="white">妳不覺得開心嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:46,964 --> 00:04:49,633
<font color="white">我當然覺得開心</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:50,592 --> 00:04:53,929
<font color="white">不過老實說我很驚訝</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:55,806 --> 00:05:00,185
<font color="white">我本來一直認為</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">是超人力霸王害我失去了母親</font></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:00,894 --> 00:05:02,813
<font color="white">後來超人力霸王救了我</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:02,896 --> 00:05:05,941
<font color="white">而我現在又即將為</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王拯救的這座城市</font></font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:06,025 --> 00:05:08,777
<font color="white">在復興祈願典禮上演出</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:09,653 --> 00:05:12,364
<font color="white">我覺得這已經不僅僅是緣分了</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,742
<font color="white">讓我感到不可思議</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:14,825 --> 00:05:15,951
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:17,745 --> 00:05:19,330
<font color="white">啊，對了</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:20,956 --> 00:05:25,919
<font color="white">你能拜託超人力霸王他們</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也來參加那個典禮嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:28,547 --> 00:05:31,341
<font color="white">不，我覺得那不太可能</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:31,425 --> 00:05:36,805
<font color="white">可是我覺得有很多人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">都想直接對超人力霸王道謝</font></font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:36,889 --> 00:05:39,558
<font color="white">你至少幫忙交涉看看嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:40,809 --> 00:05:41,935
<font color="white">不，就算妳這麼說</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:42,644 --> 00:05:44,688
<font color="white">我畢竟只是一個打工的啊</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:47,733 --> 00:05:50,110
<font color="white">早田，你怎麼看待這件事？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:50,819 --> 00:05:54,114
<font color="white">看來是因為某種原因</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:54,823 --> 00:05:59,286
<font color="white">增大了進次郎的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:01,413 --> 00:06:03,582
<font color="white">所以代表現在的裝甲</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:03,665 --> 00:06:07,753
<font color="white">已應付不了進次郎的力量？</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:10,631
<font color="white">若推究其可能的原因</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:12,424 --> 00:06:16,053
<font color="white">這也許是進次郎更進一步的覺醒</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:17,221 --> 00:06:19,348
<font color="white">更進一步的覺醒？</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:19,890 --> 00:06:22,601
<font color="white">思維太跳躍了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:23,102 --> 00:06:24,103
<font color="white">的確如此</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:24,728 --> 00:06:25,771
<font color="white">但是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:26,271 --> 00:06:29,775
<font color="white">他的力量如今還是未知數</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:30,734 --> 00:06:34,863
<font color="white">事實上還有很多我們不了解的地方</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:36,949 --> 00:06:41,036
<font color="white">可以推測之後同樣情形</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">會再次發生在進次郎身上</font></font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:42,121 --> 00:06:46,583
<font color="white">剛好此時有新戰力將加入</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">這科學特搜隊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:51,964 --> 00:06:52,965
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:02,766 --> 00:07:03,684
<font color="white">太郎先生！</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:04,643 --> 00:07:06,895
<font color="white">好久不見啊，進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:07,729 --> 00:07:10,357
<font color="white">從那次與黃金城塞的對戰後</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我們就沒見過面吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:11,316 --> 00:07:12,359
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:13,819 --> 00:07:16,238
<font color="white">不過為什麼太郎先生會在這裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:18,115 --> 00:07:23,412
<font color="white">太郎從今天開始加入日本科學特搜隊</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:23,495 --> 00:07:25,289
<font color="white">他直到幾天前</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:25,372 --> 00:07:28,584
<font color="white">在紐約分部工作了約一年的時間</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:29,376 --> 00:07:33,297
<font color="white">聽說他在那邊與傑克搭檔</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">有過許多傑出表現</font></font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:35,632
<font color="white">-沒有啦</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-太郎先生那麼厲害？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:35,716 --> 00:07:37,759
<font color="white">我們這邊卻還是老樣子</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:38,302 --> 00:07:42,556
<font color="white">我和這小子多次一起處理現場</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">但是每次都是狀況百出</font></font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:45,267
<font color="white">我們很歡迎新戰力的加入</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:45,934 --> 00:07:47,311
<font color="white">就是這樣</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:47,394 --> 00:07:49,980
<font color="white">從今天開始請多多指教啦，前輩</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:50,063 --> 00:07:51,857
<font color="white">我才不是什麼前輩</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:54,026
<font color="white">不要那樣叫我，太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:54,109 --> 00:07:56,570
<font color="white">那我就不那麼拘謹了</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:56,653 --> 00:07:59,865
<font color="white">為了不輸給你們兩位</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我在日本也得好好加油才行</font></font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:08:00,699 --> 00:08:04,411
<font color="white">還有啊，進次郎，我有話跟你說</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:04,495 --> 00:08:05,913
<font color="white">你能來一下嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:07,873 --> 00:08:08,790
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:12,127 --> 00:08:15,506
<font color="white">是關於你最近執行的任務</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:16,673 --> 00:08:19,801
<font color="white">你最近有碰到和以往不同的狀況嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:22,429 --> 00:08:23,514
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:23,597 --> 00:08:27,184
<font color="white">沒事，只是最近覺得</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:27,267 --> 00:08:31,522
<font color="white">有時候會稍微控制不住自己的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:31,605 --> 00:08:34,525
<font color="white">原來如此，果然是這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:35,984 --> 00:08:39,238
<font color="white">我們也察覺到你的力量有所變化</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:08:40,155 --> 00:08:41,114
<font color="white">正因為如此</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:08:41,198 --> 00:08:46,537
<font color="white">我們希望你能協助開發</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">新型超人力霸王裝甲</font></font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:08:49,748 --> 00:08:51,917
<font color="white">雖然早田反對這件事</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:08:53,293 --> 00:08:54,378
<font color="white">爸反對嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:55,295 --> 00:08:56,588
<font color="white">那是為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:56,672 --> 00:09:01,260
<font color="white">他可能是擔心這樣會增加你的負擔</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:02,344 --> 00:09:03,387
<font color="white">你覺得怎麼樣？</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:04,096 --> 00:09:06,807
<font color="white">這終究只是我們的提議</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:08,433 --> 00:09:09,685
<font color="white">我願意做</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:10,769 --> 00:09:14,439
<font color="white">不，請務必讓我參與</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:18,193 --> 00:09:21,280
<font color="white">進次郎，你準備好了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:21,363 --> 00:09:22,948
<font color="white">啊，準備好了</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:23,031 --> 00:09:27,327
<font color="white">不過這應該是新的裝甲吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:27,411 --> 00:09:32,624
<font color="white">對，我們這次的目的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">只是為操作系統蒐集資料</font></font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:09:32,708 --> 00:09:36,003
<font color="white">之後才會著手完成</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">包含外觀設計的其他工程</font></font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:09:36,086 --> 00:09:38,463
<font color="white">-那就開始吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-了解</font></font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:09:38,547 --> 00:09:41,550
<font color="white">聽好了，接著我們會</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">讓這台無人機飛入空中</font></font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:09:42,509 --> 00:09:45,971
<font color="white">十秒後你要追蹤它，並將其擊墜</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:09:46,722 --> 00:09:47,848
<font color="white">要做的僅只如此</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:09:48,432 --> 00:09:49,474
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:50,767 --> 00:09:54,730
<font color="white">三、二、一，開始！</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:10:08,118 --> 00:10:09,328
<font color="white">上吧</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:10:24,301 --> 00:10:27,804
<font color="white">忘了跟你說，那傢伙裝有雷射武器</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:10:27,888 --> 00:10:28,805
<font color="white">要小心</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:28,889 --> 00:10:30,974
<font color="white">-進次郎的狀況如何？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-請你早說啊！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:31,058 --> 00:10:32,893
<font color="white">到目前為止都還在正常值的範圍內</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:32,976 --> 00:10:34,686
<font color="white">數據上沒有任何異常</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:34,770 --> 00:10:35,729
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:51,036
<font color="white">任務完成！</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:52,996 --> 00:10:55,457
<font color="white">看來他的狀態很好啊</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:11:00,921 --> 00:11:02,172
<font color="white">發生緊急情況</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:04,466 --> 00:11:05,509
<font color="white">發生什麼事了？</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:06,093 --> 00:11:08,095
<font color="white">有外星人犯下大規模屠殺案</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:11:08,178 --> 00:11:09,638
<font color="white">就這樣直接去現場</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:11:10,263 --> 00:11:12,432
<font color="white">然後你們兩個和太郎在現場會合</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:12,516 --> 00:11:13,850
<font color="white">了解</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:13,934 --> 00:11:17,229
<font color="white">進次郎，我會馬上叫人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">將你原來的裝甲傳送過去</font></font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:17,312 --> 00:11:18,188
<font color="white">我們走</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:18,855 --> 00:11:19,898
<font color="white">請等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:24,236
<font color="white">能讓我就這樣</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">以這套測試裝甲行動嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:24,319 --> 00:11:27,114
<font color="white">不行，這樣風險太高</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:27,197 --> 00:11:30,242
<font color="white">我知道，但是我的直覺告訴我</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:30,325 --> 00:11:33,203
<font color="white">現在這套裝甲比較適合我</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:35,247 --> 00:11:37,999
<font color="white">伊多、早田，我們該怎麼做？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:39,042 --> 00:11:40,961
<font color="white">正常來說</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:41,670 --> 00:11:45,215
<font color="white">這種情況下應該要選擇迴避風險</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:47,175 --> 00:11:48,135
<font color="white">不過呢</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:49,761 --> 00:11:55,809
<font color="white">我們確實也無法</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就此浪費實戰測試的機會</font></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:57,811 --> 00:11:58,979
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:12:00,814 --> 00:12:02,399
<font color="white">好吧</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:12:02,482 --> 00:12:05,235
<font color="white">我准許你以測試裝甲出動</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:12:05,819 --> 00:12:07,195
<font color="white">非常感謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:12:23,378 --> 00:12:24,504
<font color="white">太殘忍了</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:12:26,173 --> 00:12:29,468
<font color="white">這副景象和那個時候一模一樣</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:12:31,344 --> 00:12:34,181
<font color="white">行兇的外星人一定還在這裡面</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:12:38,810 --> 00:12:41,521
<font color="white">我們兵分三路，一有發現立刻回報</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:12:42,355 --> 00:12:43,440
<font color="white">收到</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:58,455 --> 00:13:00,499
<font color="white">我們終於見到面了</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:13:03,502 --> 00:13:06,004
<font color="white">你就是那個超人力霸王吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:13:07,464 --> 00:13:10,133
<font color="white">你是那時的外星人！</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:13:12,761 --> 00:13:16,097
<font color="white">我可是第一次見到你啊</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:13:16,181 --> 00:13:17,474
<font color="white">不管怎樣…</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:13:19,434 --> 00:13:22,312
<font color="white">就讓遊戲開始吧！</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:13:28,693 --> 00:13:29,778
<font color="white">怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:13:29,861 --> 00:13:30,904
<font color="white">我找到他了！</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:13:45,418 --> 00:13:48,547
<font color="white">糟糕，讓他逃了，我去追他</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:13:48,630 --> 00:13:49,839
<font color="white">喂，等等！</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:54,052
<font color="white">超人力霸王正在追捕外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:13:55,262 --> 00:13:56,763
<font color="white">他們正向市中心前進</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:14:18,535 --> 00:14:19,619
<font color="white">站住！</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:14:21,037 --> 00:14:22,289
<font color="white">他消失到哪裡去了？</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:14:37,637 --> 00:14:40,640
<font color="white">真是佩服，不愧是你</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:14:41,141 --> 00:14:43,768
<font color="white">其實我還擔心了一下</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:14:44,477 --> 00:14:46,730
<font color="white">想說那種程度的殘羹剩飯</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:14:46,813 --> 00:14:52,402
<font color="white">可能現在名聞天下的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王大人不會理會呢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:14:53,528 --> 00:14:54,696
<font color="white">你該不會</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:14:55,238 --> 00:14:57,782
<font color="white">只是為了引我們出來</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:14:57,866 --> 00:14:59,284
<font color="white">就殺了那麼多人？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:14:59,367 --> 00:15:02,662
<font color="white">我怎麼可能跟你講那麼多細節</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:15:02,746 --> 00:15:06,458
<font color="white">不過我能告訴你一件事</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:15:06,541 --> 00:15:11,338
<font color="white">接下來將有更加有趣的遊戲要開始了</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:15:15,467 --> 00:15:16,509
{\an8}<font color="white">開什麼…</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:19,638
<font color="white">開什麼玩笑！</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:15:25,393 --> 00:15:27,687
<font color="white">超人力霸王裝甲的力量增加</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:15:27,771 --> 00:15:29,356
<font color="white">已接近限制值</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:15:34,903 --> 00:15:37,280
<font color="white">裝甲的力量已突破限制值</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:15:37,364 --> 00:15:38,281
<font color="white">你說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:15:39,115 --> 00:15:40,241
<font color="white">小子…</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:15:42,869 --> 00:15:44,663
<font color="white">竟然對那些無辜的人們那麼做</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:15:46,289 --> 00:15:48,124
{\an8}<font color="white">還奪走他們的性命！</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:15:51,628 --> 00:15:52,921
{\an8}<font color="white">那傢伙…</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:15:59,886 --> 00:16:03,682
<font color="white">這到底是怎麼回事？進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:16:04,391 --> 00:16:06,351
<font color="white">有需要做到這種程度嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:16:14,734 --> 00:16:15,944
<font color="white">該回去了</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:16:17,487 --> 00:16:18,697
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:24,828
<font color="white">原來如此</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:16:25,537 --> 00:16:27,372
<font color="white">很有意思的數據</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:16:28,164 --> 00:16:29,207
<font color="white">但是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:16:30,041 --> 00:16:33,044
<font color="white">這個開頭只能說是馬馬虎虎</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:16:35,213 --> 00:16:36,840
<font color="white">超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:16:48,935 --> 00:16:50,437
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:16:55,442 --> 00:16:56,985
<font color="white">我很抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:16:58,111 --> 00:17:00,321
<font color="white">你用不著道歉</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:17:01,489 --> 00:17:06,494
<font color="white">是我們批准你去做規定之外的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那就應該由我們來負責才對</font></font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:17:08,413 --> 00:17:11,541
<font color="white">至今我認為能好好辦到的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:17:13,001 --> 00:17:13,877
<font color="white">最近卻…</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:17:16,212 --> 00:17:17,464
<font color="white">到底是為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:22,886
<font color="white">進次郎，你所感覺到的那種變化</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:17:22,969 --> 00:17:28,141
<font color="white">伊多似乎認為是你更進一步的覺醒</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:17:29,184 --> 00:17:31,019
<font color="white">更進一步的覺醒？</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:17:31,936 --> 00:17:34,981
<font color="white">但是你的力量仍不穩定</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:17:35,065 --> 00:17:39,360
<font color="white">而測試裝甲好像</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也還不足以控制那股力量</font></font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:17:41,571 --> 00:17:43,782
<font color="white">我們會繼續進行裝甲的測試</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:17:44,824 --> 00:17:47,994
<font color="white">不過我們決定暫時</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">不將其投入於實戰中</font></font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:17:49,662 --> 00:17:50,872
<font color="white">我了解</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:10,475
<font color="white">“今晚有典禮彩排，請過來看</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:18:10,558 --> 00:18:13,978
{\an8}<font color="white">還有拜託超人力霸王的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也拜託你了”</font></font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:18:14,521 --> 00:18:15,855
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:18:17,273 --> 00:18:18,316
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:18:21,277 --> 00:18:22,320
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:18:31,496 --> 00:18:36,501
<font color="white">抱歉，你從一開始</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就反對測試裝甲吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:18:38,086 --> 00:18:43,383
<font color="white">你只是遵從了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">科學特搜隊所下的決定而已</font></font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:18:44,050 --> 00:18:48,555
<font color="white">況且我並不反對測試這件事</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:18:49,055 --> 00:18:50,682
<font color="white">那你反對的是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:18:51,391 --> 00:18:52,559
<font color="white">這個嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:18:57,230 --> 00:18:58,606
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:18:58,690 --> 00:19:01,192
<font color="white">早田，你能過來一下嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:19:01,276 --> 00:19:02,777
<font color="white">好，我馬上過去</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:19:03,987 --> 00:19:06,030
<font color="white">你今天會直接回家？</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:19:06,614 --> 00:19:10,827
<font color="white">不，有朋友約我去復興典禮的會場</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:19:10,910 --> 00:19:13,663
<font color="white">這樣啊，抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:19:22,046 --> 00:19:23,214
<font color="white">（復興祈願典禮）</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:19:23,298 --> 00:19:26,885
<font color="white">今天非常感謝大家</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:19:26,968 --> 00:19:30,346
<font color="white">（復興祈願典禮</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">佐山玲奈特別演唱會）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:19:30,430 --> 00:19:31,681
<font color="white">表現得很棒喔，玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:19:31,764 --> 00:19:33,349
<font color="white">謝謝你的誇獎</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:19:33,892 --> 00:19:37,520
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">復興祈願典禮）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:19:38,229 --> 00:19:39,439
<font color="white">辛苦妳了</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:19:39,981 --> 00:19:42,025
<font color="white">那明天就拜託妳照這樣演出了</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:19:42,108 --> 00:19:43,860
<font color="white">-好，沒問題</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-很好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:19:44,694 --> 00:19:46,237
<font color="white">喂，等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:19:46,321 --> 00:19:48,531
<font color="white">是誰讓這傢伙進來的？</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:19:48,615 --> 00:19:50,408
<font color="white">你不能進來這裡</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:19:50,491 --> 00:19:53,203
<font color="white">除了相關人員，其他人不能進來</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:19:53,286 --> 00:19:55,413
<font color="white">-天啊！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-喂，你搞什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:19:56,164 --> 00:19:57,874
<font color="white">給我安分一點</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:20:14,182 --> 00:20:15,099
<font color="white">爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:20:15,934 --> 00:20:18,102
<font color="white">進次郎，你現在在哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:20:18,186 --> 00:20:20,521
<font color="white">問我在哪裡？現在正要去典禮會場</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:20:20,605 --> 00:20:22,732
<font color="white">聽說那裡有外星人出現</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:20:24,025 --> 00:20:25,526
<font color="white">那是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:20:25,610 --> 00:20:26,986
<font color="white">又是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:20:32,825 --> 00:20:34,327
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:20:51,386 --> 00:20:53,388
<font color="white">玲奈，我們得趕快逃跑</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:20:57,392 --> 00:20:58,476
<font color="white">這種時候…</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:21:01,187 --> 00:21:02,063
<font color="white">一定會…</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:21:08,861 --> 00:21:09,988
<font color="white">我就知道！</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:21:15,118 --> 00:21:16,244
<font color="white">是超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:21:17,203 --> 00:21:19,038
<font color="white">就交給你啦，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:22:25,396 --> 00:22:26,522
<font color="white">超人力霸王…</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:24:06,038 --> 00:24:09,125
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：黃可涵</font><font color="white"></font>

